  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童69件插珠帐篷拼搭套装",
    "en": "Kids 69-piece Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童插珠帐篷拼搭玩具，采用PP材质和杆球组合结构，支持拆装房子、帐篷等多种创意搭建玩法，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动与亲子游戏场景。\n\n品牌为LONDY，产地东莞茶山，具备实用新型相关知识产权，支持500套起彩盒定制。",
    "en": "This is a kids bead-and-rod fort building toy made of PP material. It supports detachable house and tent-style builds for family interaction, classroom activities, and parent-child play scenarios.\n\nBrand: LONDY. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. The product is associated with utility-model intellectual property and supports color-box customization from 500 sets."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童69件插珠帐篷拼搭套装采用杆件与连接球组合结构，能够快速搭建帐篷、房屋和通道等形态，适合儿童进行连续的创意构建体验。",
      "产品定位于亲子互动与益智训练场景，可用于家庭游戏、课堂活动和兴趣课程。通过反复拼搭可支持空间认知、动手动脑与协作类玩法。",
      "包装为彩盒，提供标准化尺寸与体积参数，便于渠道陈列和仓配管理。支持500套起定制彩盒，适合批量项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This 69-piece kids fort building set uses a rod-and-connector-ball structure that enables quick construction of tents, houses, and tunnel-style layouts for continuous creative play.",
      "It is positioned for parent-child interaction and educational play scenarios, including home activities, classroom sessions, and hobby programs. Repeated building supports spatial cognition, hands-on practice, and collaborative play.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging and provides standardized size and volume data for channel display and warehouse operations. Color-box customization is supported from 500 sets for batch procurement projects."
    ]
  },
